  "strategy": "Hazel of the Rootbloom taps the deck's tokens for mana and copies a token at every end step, two when it is a Squirrel, so the board doubles in Squirrels and Food while Chatterstorm, Scurry of Squirrels, Squirrel Nest, Deep Forest Hermit and Chatterfang keep adding more. Chatterfang, Ravenous Squirrel, Insatiable Frugivore, Deadly Dispute and Plaguecrafter turn those tokens into fuel, and Zulaport Cutthroat, Bastion of Remembrance, Nadier's Nightblade and Poison-Tip Archer drain the table as the Squirrels die. Squirrel Sovereign, Honored Dreyleader, The Odd Acorn Gang, Sword of the Squeak and End-Raze Forerunners make the swarm big enough to swing, and Second Harvest, Gourmand's Talent and Hazel's Brewmaster double down on the Food and Squirrels already in play.",
